{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791438180, "covers_from": "2026-10-08T05:43:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-08T05:44:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791438240, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-08T05:43:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 59040, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "應該可以再適量的增加路邊停車格的規劃，（包含汽車、機車）！目前大安區的汽車停車格多數都改成機車格！", "display_name": "大安代表 ⛳大偉🏄🏻", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-08T05:43:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 1405, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "建議台北所有的路口都採用人車分離的紅綠燈通行 降低路口發生行人交通事故的風險 也讓開車的人更安心", "display_name": "松山代表 No.1,405", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-08T05:43:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 37748, "sprite_key": "bear_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "其他", "content": "沈伯洋加油", "display_name": "信義代表 No.37,748", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-08T05:43:35+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 2069, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "公車加速猛煞車急，乘客危險、搭乘體驗不佳", "display_name": "文山代表 No.2,069", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-08T05:43:41+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 27433, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "請不要把紅路燈（或電線桿）蓋在人行道/斑馬線的正中間，又醜又危險。", "display_name": "大安代表 Andy®", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-08T05:43:52+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 22313, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "環境", "content": "不要再砍樹了", "display_name": "士林代表 No.22,313", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 1405, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_n